<< /Alt (Flow: Kingdom Hall property titling and sales. Stated purpose: Kingdom Halls \(the congregations' meeting places\) are presented as places of worship.. How it controls: Local congregations fundraise and build, in many countries the organization or a national trust holds title, and the organization has sold consolidated properties for large sums.. Who benefits: Watch Tower entities benefit.) /K [ 4955 0 R 6381 0 R 4232 0 R ] /P 6099 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
